  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    sep_val = None\n    h_seps = []\n    for r in range(rows):\n        if all(grid[r][c] != 0 for c in range(cols)):\n            sep_val = grid[r][0]\n            h_seps.append(r)\n    \n    v_seps = []\n    for c in range(cols):\n        if all(grid[r][c] != 0 for r in range(rows)):\n            v_seps.append(c)\n    \n    row_bounds = []\n    prev = 0\n    for s in h_seps:\n        row_bounds.append((prev, s))\n        prev = s + 1\n    row_bounds.append((prev, rows))\n    \n    col_bounds = []\n    prev = 0\n    for s in v_seps:\n        col_bounds.append((prev, s))\n        prev = s + 1\n    col_bounds.append((prev, cols))\n    \n    union = set()\n    for rb in row_bounds:\n        for cb in col_bounds:\n            for r in range(rb[0], rb[1]):\n                for c in range(cb[0], cb[1]):\n                    if grid[r][c] != 0 and grid[r][c] != sep_val:\n                        union.add((r - rb[0], c - cb[0]))\n    \n    out = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    for rb in row_bounds:\n        for cb in col_bounds:\n            for lr, lc in union:\n                r, c = rb[0] + lr, cb[0] + lc\n                if out[r][c] == 0:\n                    out[r][c] = sep_val\n    \n    return out\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    sep_val = None\n    h_seps = []\n    for r in range(rows):\n        if all(grid[r][c] != 0 for c in range(cols)):\n            sep_val = grid[r][0]\n            h_seps.append(r)\n    \n    v_seps = []\n    for c in range(cols):\n        if all(grid[r][c] != 0 for r in range(rows)):\n            v_seps.append(c)\n    \n    row_bounds = []\n    prev = 0\n    for s in h_seps:\n        row_bounds.append((prev, s))\n        prev = s + 1\n    row_bounds.append((prev, rows))\n    \n    col_bounds = []\n    prev = 0\n    for s in v_seps:\n        col_bounds.append((prev, s))\n        prev = s + 1\n    col_bounds.append((prev, cols))\n    \n    union = set()\n    for rb in row_bounds:\n        for cb in col_bounds:\n            for r in range(rb[0], rb[1]):\n                for c in range(cb[0], cb[1]):\n                    if grid[r][c] != 0 and grid[r][c] != sep_val:\n                        union.add((r - rb[0], c - cb[0]))\n    \n    out = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    for rb in row_bounds:\n        for cb in col_bounds:\n            for lr, lc in union:\n                r, c = rb[0] + lr, cb[0] + lc\n                if out[r][c] == 0:\n                    out[r][c] = sep_val\n    \n    return out",
